From 3a07a4ca7f20effb4e08115a1a8da2394c8ef93f Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Igal Zeltser <izeltser@habana.ai>
Date: Tue, 30 Aug 2022 18:46:59 +0300
Subject: [PATCH] [SW-102459] boot_info: move source to lib common

Since boot info functions will be used for gaudi3 ppboot, the source
file is moved to lib/common folder. crc32 source is moved as well
because it's being used by the boot info.

Change-Id: I6d1c1cc01a8123c9252278796ee1b997c6184cd2
Signed-off-by: Igal Zeltser <izeltser@habana.ai>
---

